        "original_id": "5626ec83-1edb-5926-89de-20d8a5f21979",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2010 Teen Choice Awards, 2011 Teen Choice Awards\n- People: Kaley Cuoco, Lucy Hale\n- Roles: Penny, Aria Montgomery\n- TV Series: The Big Bang Theory\n- Networks: Fox, CBS\n\nFacts:\n- In 2010, Lucy Hale was named Choice Summer TV Star: Female at the 2010 Teen Choice Awards for her role in the series associated with Aria Montgomery.\n- Since 2007, Kaley Cuoco has starred as Penny on the CBS sitcom The Big Bang Theory.\n- Kaley Cuoco has received Satellite, Critics' Choice, and People's Choice Awards for playing Penny on The Big Bang Theory.\n- On August 7, 2011, the 2011 Teen Choice Awards ceremony aired live at 8/7c on Fox.\n- Kaley Cuoco hosted the 2011 Teen Choice Awards ceremony.\n- In 2011, Lucy Hale was named Choice Summer TV Star: Female at the 2011 Teen Choice Awards for her role in the series associated with Aria Montgomery.",
